      "body": "IntraSoft Technologies Limited announced the appointment of Mrs. Poonam Luharuka (Membership No. A60701) as Company Secretary and Compliance Officer (Key Managerial Personnel) of the Company with immediate effect. Poonam Luharuka is a commerce graduate with a strong foundation in finance and accounting, recognized for clear business communication, strong team ethics and the ability to deliver high-quality outcomes under tight deadlines. She is a qualified Company Secretary (CS) and has also completed CA Final (Group II), bringing a well-rounded blend of financial, accounting, and compliance expertise to her work. She has supported clients across core finance and regulatory responsibilities—income tax e-filing, audit procedures and financial statement preparation, tax audit reporting, ROC f",
